# Who may sign each dependency (pgpverify-maven-plugin, see pom.xml). Every dependency must be
# listed: a new one, or a release signed with a different key, fails the build until it's added here.
#
# Before adding a key, check it belongs to the project, not just to a matching name: anyone can make
# a key with any name on it. See "Updating Chromium" in SCOPE.md.

# jcefmaven and Chromium (jcef-api, jcef-natives-*): Fritz Windisch's release key since jcefmaven
# 146.0.10. jcefmaven switched keys on 2026-05-05 in a signed commit by its maintainer ("Update GPG
# private key", 67099e3 in jcefmaven/jcefmaven), 18 minutes before that release; 141.0.10 and
# earlier were signed with the 2021 key below.
me.friwi:jcefmaven                  = 0xAB89 4142 CD86 07B7 074E  912A B2AE 8D1D 31A0 113A
me.friwi:jcef-api                   = 0xAB89 4142 CD86 07B7 074E  912A B2AE 8D1D 31A0 113A
me.friwi:jcef-natives-windows-amd64 = 0xAB89 4142 CD86 07B7 074E  912A B2AE 8D1D 31A0 113A

# JOGL and GlueGen v2.4.0, republished by jcefmaven in 2021 and signed with its earlier key.
me.friwi:jogl-all                   = 0xEED2 9BAB 8D4F D882 D623  08CD 72D1 B04B C7E6 AA04
me.friwi:gluegen-rt                 = 0xEED2 9BAB 8D4F D882 D623  08CD 72D1 B04B C7E6 AA04

